  "description": {
   "en": "One day, Akari, a high school student, is told by her childhood friend Eita, “I...have a boyfriend\". The boyfriend, a classmate named Sanae, is mature in contrast to the childish Eita. Akari becomes increasingly curious about their relationship and how they got together, and decides to observe them...\n\nThis is a gentle and heartwarming BL comedy from a girl's point of view!"
